			"notes": "### Added\n- Ships and structures now load through the datapack resource system. Custom ships can be added via datapacks without modifying the mod\n- `/hostileskies ships` command to list all registered ships\n- `CUSTOM_SHIPS.md` guide for datapack authors\n- `docs/ExampleDatapack` as a template for datapack authors\n\n### Changed\n- Ship IDs are now namespaced (e.g. `hostile_skies:karve_t1`). Existing worlds are fully compatible\n- Structure loading uses vanilla's StructureTemplateManager instead of classpath loading"
